<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n41391" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἐπίτομ-ος</span></b> , <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ον</span>,
			<div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>cut off,</i>
			<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἐ. ξύλα</span> timber <i>cut in short
				lengths</i> for the joiner, <i><span class="en">
				Thphr.
				<u>HP</u>
				5.1.12
			</span></i>, cf. <i><span class="en">
				3.13.1
			</span></i> (of bark). </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>2.</b>
			<i>short, compendious,</i>
			
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ὁδός</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					D.H.
					1.68
				</span></i>
			, <i><span class="en">
				Ph.
				2.25
			</span></i> ; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τὰ ἐ. τῆς χώρας</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Paus.
					10.31.7
				</span></i>
			 ; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἐπίτομον δείξας ἢ λεωφόρον</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					D.Chr.
					18.4
				</span></i>
			 ; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">περαιώσεις</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Hld.
					10.4
				</span></i>
			. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>3.</b>
			<i>abridged,</i>
			<i><span class="en">
				Max.Tyr.
				31.2
			</span></i>, Suid.
				s.v.
				<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">Διογενειανός.</span>
			
			Adv.
			<b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἐπιτόμ-ως</span></b> 
			<i><span class="en">
				Phld.
				<u>Sign.</u>
				28
			</span></i> : 
				Comp.
			
			
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">-ώτερον</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					A.D.
					<u>Pron.</u>
					3.8
				</span></i>
			, <i><span class="en">
				<u>Synt.</u>
				215.9
			</span></i>.</div>
